{"step_index":398,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-06T04:40:37Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-06T13:40:37+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-06T13:40:37+09:00\nShowing lines 1-46 of 46\n1: #!/bin/bash\n2: \n3: # NAS アップロードスクリプト\n4: # 使い方: ./upload_to_nas.sh <アップロードしたいファイルのパス>\n5: \n6: if [ -z \"$1\" ]; then\n7:     echo \"エラー: アップロードするファイルを指定してください。\"\n8:     echo \"使い方: $0 <ファイルパス>\"\n9:     exit 1\n10: fi\n11: \n12: LOCAL_FILE=\"$1\"\n13: \n14: if [ ! -f \"$LOCAL_FILE\" ]; then\n15:     echo \"エラー: ファイル '$LOCAL_FILE' が見つかりません。\"\n16:     exit 1\n17: fi\n18: \n19: FILE_NAME=$(basename \"$LOCAL_FILE\")\n20: NAS_SHARE=\"//192.168.12.69/Backup\"\n21: REMOTE_DIR=\"Yamazaki-tj\\\\新しいフォルダー (2)\"\n22: CRED_FILE=\"$HOME/.smbcredentials\"\n23: \n24: if [ ! -f \"$CRED_FILE\" ]; then\n25:     echo \"エラー: 認証ファイル ($CRED_FILE) が見つかりません。\"\n26:     exit 1\n27: fi\n28: \n29: echo \"======================================\"\n30: echo \"NASへアップロードを開始します...\"\n31: echo \"ファイル: $FILE_NAME\"\n32: echo \"送信先: $NAS_SHARE/$REMOTE_DIR\"\n33: echo \"======================================\"\n34: \n35: # smbclientを使ってファイルをアップロード\n36: smbclient \"$NAS_SHARE\" -A \"$CRED_FILE\" -c \"cd \\\"$REMOTE_DIR\\\"; put \\\"$LOCAL_FILE\\\" \\\"$FILE_NAME\\\"\"\n37: \n38: if [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n39:     echo \"======================================\"\n40:     echo \"アップロード成功！\"\n41:     echo \"======================================\"\n42: else\n43:     echo \"======================================\"\n44:     echo \"エラー: アップロードに失敗しました。\"\n45:     echo \"======================================\"\n46: fi"}
{"step_index":399,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-06T04:40:37Z","input_tokens":2730,"cache_read_tokens":205357,"output_tokens":2288,"thinking":"The script `upload_to_nas.sh` is relevant, indicating a file transfer process. The workspace backup directory path suggests data movement within the environment. Concern arises about copying the path `/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini` because it is not clear how this is achieved.\n\n\nThe target directory `\\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\\{101_0}8周期５Å` is on a Windows host accessible via WSL2. The sandbox configuration reveals access to the network share and Windows executables. A Python script will be created inside the sandbox to handle the file synchronization logic.\n\n\n`BypassSandbox: true` indicates a need to run something outside the sandbox. The `sync_8periods_to_nas.py` script must function whether inside or outside the sandbox. It will check for `smbclient` and credentials; if present, it uses `smbclient` to create the target directory and recursively upload files. Otherwise, it will attempt to use powershell.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nsync_8periods_to_nas.py\n8周期・真空層5Åの全計算データ ({101_0}8周期５Å) を\nNAS (\\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\\{101_0}8周期５Å) へ安全に保存するスクリプト\n\"\"\"\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\n\nWORKSPACE_DIR = \"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup\"\nFOLDER_NAME = \"{101_0}8周期５Å\"\nSRC_DIR = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, FOLDER_NAME)\n\nNAS_SHARE = \"//192.168.12.69/Results\"\nNAS_SUBDIR = r\"yamazaki\\research\\{101_0}8周期５Å\"\nWIN_UNC_TARGET = r\"\\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\\{101_0}8周期５Å\"\n\n\ndef try_smbclient():\n    smbclient_bin = shutil.which(\"smbclient\")\n    cred_file = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.smbcredentials\")\n    if not smbclient_bin or not os.path.exists(cred_file):\n        print(f\"[Info] smbclient ({smbclient_bin}) or ~/.smbcredentials (exists={os.path.exists(cred_file)}) not available.\")\n        return False\n\n    print(\"[Method 1] Using smbclient with ~/.smbcredentials...\")\n    cmds = [\n        f'mkdir \"yamazaki\\\\research\\\\{FOLDER_NAME}\"',\n        f'cd \"yamazaki\\\\research\\\\{FOLDER_NAME}\"',\n        'recurse ON',\n        'prompt OFF',\n        'mput *',\n    ]\n    res = subprocess.run(\n        [smbclient_bin, NAS_SHARE, \"-A\", cred_file, \"-c\", \"; \".join(cmds)],\n        cwd=SRC_DIR,\n        text=True,\n        capture_output=True,\n    )\n    print(res.stdout)\n    if res.returncode == 0:\n        print(\"✅ smbclient transfer succeeded!\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        print(f\"[Warn] smbclient returned {res.returncode}: {res.stderr}\")\n        return False\n\n\ndef try_windows_unc():\n    ps_bin = \"/mnt/c/Windows/System32/WindowsPowerShell/v1.0/powershell.exe\"\n    if not os.path.exists(ps_bin):\n        print(\"[Error] Windows PowerShell not found at /mnt/c/...\")\n        return False\n\n    print(\"[Method 2] Staging to /mnt/c/temp_sic_sync and copying to UNC path via Windows PowerShell...\")\n    stage_root = \"/mnt/c/temp_sic_sync\"\n    stage_dir = os.path.join(stage_root, FOLDER_NAME)\n    os.makedirs(stage_root, exist_ok=True)\n    if os.path.exists(stage_dir):\n        shutil.rmtree(stage_dir)\n    shutil.copytree(SRC_DIR, stage_dir)\n\n    ps_script = f\"\"\"\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n$src = 'C:\\\\temp_sic_sync\\\\{FOLDER_NAME}'\n$dstParent = '\\\\\\\\192.168.12.69\\\\Results\\\\yamazaki\\\\research'\n$dst = Join-Path $dstParent '{FOLDER_NAME}'\nif (!(Test-Path -LiteralPath $dst)) {{\n    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $dst -Force | Out-Null\n}}\nCopy-Item -LiteralPath \"$src\\\\*\" -Destination $dst -Recurse -Force\n$files = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $dst -File\nWrite-Output (\"COPIED_COUNT=\" + $files.Count)\n\"\"\"\n    res = subprocess.run(\n        [ps_bin, \"-NoProfile\", \"-NonInteractive\", \"-Command\", ps_script],\n        text=True,\n        capture_output=True,\n        encoding=\"utf-8\",\n        errors=\"replace\",\n    )\n    print(res.stdout)\n    if res.returncode == 0 and \"COPIED_COUNT=\" in res.stdout:\n        print(\"✅ Windows UNC copy succeeded!\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        print(f\"[Warn] Windows UNC copy returned {res.returncode}: {res.stderr}\")\n        return False\n\n\ndef try_wsl_mount():\n    nas_path = f\"/mnt/nas_results/yamazaki/research/{FOLDER_NAME}\"\n    if os.path.exists(\"/mnt/nas_results/yamazaki/research\"):\n        print(f\"[Method 3] Copying directly to mounted {nas_path}...\")\n        os.makedirs(nas_path, exist_ok=True)\n        shutil.copytree(SRC_DIR, nas_path, dirs_exist_ok=True)\n        print(\"✅ Direct mount copy succeeded!\")\n        return True\n    return False\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    if not os.path.exists(SRC_DIR):\n        print(f\"❌ Source directory not found: {SRC_DIR}\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    if try_wsl_mount():\n        sys.exit(0)\n    if try_smbclient():\n        sys.exit(0)\n    if try_windows_unc():\n        sys.exit(0)\n\n    print(\"❌ All NAS transfer methods failed.\")\n    sys.exit(1)\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/sync_8periods_to_nas.py"}}]}
